OL,3,GNEWSA'Jewel in the crown' theatre in
OL,4,Aline for #8m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for an #8m refurbishment of a
OL,7,Ftheatre in Hinckley have been approved.
OL,9,FProposals to transform the town's
OL,10,FConcordia Theatre include a new front
OL,11,Fentrance and box office area, a
OL,12,Fredesigned auditorium seating layout
OL,13,Fand the removal of a ceiling above the
OL,14,Fseating to expose original roof
OL,15,Ftimbers.
OL,17,FPlanning committee chairwoman Joyce
OL,18,FCrooks described the theatre as the
OL,19,F"jewel in the crown" of the town, after
OL,20,FHinckley and Bosworth Borough Council's
OL,21,Fplanning committee unanimously backed
OL,22,Fthe scheme on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
