OL,3,GNEWSA'Jewel in the crown' theatre in
OL,4,Aline for #8m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme forms part of the venue's
OL,7,FProject 2030 programme, which aims to
OL,8,Fmodernise the theatre and secure its
OL,9,Ffuture, according to the Local
OL,10,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS).
